        <mxCell id="0XuRoIDHrA27UM8weoBv-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Copperweld Corp. v. Independence Tube Corp&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- A wholly encompassed subsidiary is immune from atintrust law&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- even if holding dosn&#39;t stand for partial subsidiary we can use the reasoning that we care becuse we care if they are competing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;Example: 80% parent ownership is not competing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&#x9;30% parent ownership there is competition&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="430" x="450" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-5" edge="1" parent="1" source="0XuRoIDHrA27UM8weoBv-2" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-4" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-7" edge="1" parent="1" source="0XuRoIDHrA27UM8weoBv-2" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-6" value="">
