        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0XuRoIDHrA27UM8weoBv-2" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;Fourth Amendment &amp;amp; Individual § 1983 Liability (Count I)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;The Claim: Captain Quick’s mistaken entry into the Nguyens&#39; home to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;execute an arrest warrant for a third party (Jacob Patterson) violated the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Fourth Amendment, and his mistake was not objectively reasonable [JA 2, 25].&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; The Defense: Captain Quick is shielded by Qualified Immunity because&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;his mistake was an objectively reasonable mistake of fact, and the right&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;was not &quot;clearly established&quot; with specificity in November 2024 [JA 8, 25, 32].&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="430" x="-700" y="550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-17" edge="1" parent="1" source="0XuRoIDHrA27UM8weoBv-6" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-16" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-19" edge="1" parent="1" source="0XuRoIDHrA27UM8weoBv-6" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-18" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-21" edge="1" parent="1" source="0XuRoIDHrA27UM8weoBv-6" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-20" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-23" edge="1" parent="1" source="0XuRoIDHrA27UM8weoBv-6" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-22" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0XuRoIDHrA27UM8weoBv-6" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;Fifth Amendment Inverse Condemnation&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;The Claim: The SWAT team&#39;s physical destruction of the Nguyens&#39; home ($112,678 in damages) to execute a warrant was a public &quot;taking&quot; of private property for public use, requiring &quot;just compensation&quot; under the Fifth Amendment [JA 3]. The Defense: Tactical law enforcement damage is a non-compensable exercise of the state&#39;s emergency Police Power (or necessity), which operates as an exception to the Takings Clause [JA 9, 26, 32].&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="430" x="-10" y="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0XuRoIDHrA27UM8weoBv-8" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Municipal Liability &amp;amp; Section 1983 Policy/Custom&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;The Claim: Mission City is liable under § 1983 because its City Council—the final policymaking body—voted to deny the Nguyens just compensation, thereby officially executing the municipal policy that completed the Fifth Amendment violation [JA 3–4, 28]. The Defense: There was no municipal policy to raid the wrong home, and the City cannot be held liable under a vicarious liability (respondeat superior) theory [JA 28, 32].&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="430" x="620" y="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Fourth Claim for Relief (Unjust Enrichment against Defendant Mission City)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Fourth Claim for Relief (Unjust Enrichment against Defendant Mission City): A common-law equitable claim alleging that Mission City received a measurable benefit by entering and using the Nguyens&#39; home without their consent, which is unjust for the City to retain without restitution [JA 4, 29].&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="430" x="1130" y="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-4" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&quot;honest mistake&quot; doctrine&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Maryland v. Garrison (1987)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="300" x="-950" y="790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-6" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Qualified Immunity&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Anderson v. Creighton (1987)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="270" x="-850" y="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-8" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Qualified immunity is denied when a warrant is so facially deficient&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Anderson v. Creighton (1987)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="320" x="-770" y="960" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-11" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Prior case with duplicate facts&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Hope v. Pelzer (2002&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="250" x="-530" y="865" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-14" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&quot;totality of the circumstances&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;District of Columbia v. Wesby (2018)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="270" x="-400" y="950" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-16" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;Right of action for inverse condemnation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Knick v. Township of Scott (2019)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="300" x="-240" y="780" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-18" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;per se physical taking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Cedar Point Nursery v. Hassid (2021)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
